                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "00a0fc70-8308-3359-b63c-b484506b04bd",
                        "entry_id": "89f97d40-7003-327d-be5f-aafd458a3fa7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "свойство по значению прилагательного респектабельный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e1c456ce-c00a-488f-982e-7bf46f6d325d",
                                "sense_id": "00a0fc70-8308-3359-b63c-b484506b04bd",
                                "text": "Когда медовый месяц воли, визитов, нарядов прошел, новобрачной стало невыносимо скучно, муж, несмотря на то, что тщательно сохранял респектабельность, возил её в театр и делал чайные вечера — ей опротивел, она побилась с ним года три-четыре, устала и уехала к матери."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "efba772c-d708-4404-9435-5739570d1289",
                                "sense_id": "00a0fc70-8308-3359-b63c-b484506b04bd",
                                "text": "И ещё меня мучил цинизм, с каким внешняя респектабельность и благопристойность нашего учреждения маскировали скрытый в нём ужас."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9523c02b-dde3-4758-9675-6d9c9c577eb1",
                        "source_entry_id": "89f97d40-7003-327d-be5f-aafd458a3fa7",
                        "source_sense_id": "00a0fc70-8308-3359-b63c-b484506b04bd",
                        "target_lang_word": "respectability",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "respectability",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74b9b583-2c0f-3443-938f-27b9bb246b34",
                                        "entry_id": "baee8848-de7c-30ac-a54c-459dfc499af1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being respectable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ecbb8e90-ce9b-4646-946e-4912799e11a8",
                                                "sense_id": "74b9b583-2c0f-3443-938f-27b9bb246b34",
                                                "text": "Such a scandal as the prosecution of a brother for forgery—with a verdict of guilty—is a most truly horrible, deplorable, fatal thing. It takes the respectability out of a family perhaps at a critical moment, when the family is just assuming the robes of respectability: […] it is a black spot which all the soaps ever advertised could never wash off."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59f16d70-5d03-4643-861e-79c070b1b44e",
                                                "sense_id": "74b9b583-2c0f-3443-938f-27b9bb246b34",
                                                "text": "But once again Hodgson's men found a way to get the result they required and there is a real air of respectability about their campaign even though they had to survive a first-half siege from a Ukraine side desperate for the win they needed to progress."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "950908c6-af2d-3809-bfe1-ac471473ec19",
                                        "entry_id": "baee8848-de7c-30ac-a54c-459dfc499af1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The class of respectable people."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2e0d448a-b292-4fc2-bb61-825c4660e47b",
                        "source_entry_id": "89f97d40-7003-327d-be5f-aafd458a3fa7",
                        "source_sense_id": "00a0fc70-8308-3359-b63c-b484506b04bd",
